# Turn the CSVs Allrun grepped out of the two solver logs into a pass/fail.
# The quantities and tolerances are the case's own; the comparison itself is
# shared.  Exits non-zero on a failure, so it can gate a run.
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------

exec julia --project=../../.. checks.jl "$@"

